          %h2#Definition Definition
          %h3#RationalizationOfAHomotopyType Rationalization of a homotopy type
          %p
            We discuss here what it means for a map of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+types"} homotopy types
            to exhibit the rationalization of its
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/domain"} domain
          %p
